scription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-07-13T19:26:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T10:09:20Z","closed_at":"2026-08-18T10:09:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121336","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121336.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121336.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes godotengine/godot#121264.\n\n`BoneTwistDisperser3D::_make_joints_dirty()` defers `_update_joints(index)`. If settings are cleared before the deferred call runs, the saved index can be stale and `_update_joints()` dereferences `settings[p_index]` without re-validating it.\n\nThis adds the same index guard used by the other setting/joint helpers before `_update_joints()` reads the settings array.\n\nVerification:\n\nThe `repro/Node.tscn` command below uses the MRP from godotengine/godot#121264. The final run is the post-fix behavior: it reports the guarded out-of-bounds error and exits cleanly instead of crashing.\n\n```text\n$ python3 -m SCons platform=macos target=template_debug dev_build=yes tools=no vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no -j4\nscons: done building targets.\nINFO: Time elapsed: 00:05:19.87\n\n$ python3 -m SCons platform=macos target=template_debug dev_build=yes tools=no vulkan=no angle=no accesskit=no disable_path_overrides=no -j4\nscons: done building targets.\nINFO: Time elapsed: 00:07:06.91\n\n$ ./bin/godot.macos.template_debug.dev.arm64 --headless --path repro Node.tscn\nGodot Engine v4.8.dev.custom_build.4efc6b49e (2026-07-13 18:51:09 UTC) - https://godotengine.org\nERROR: Index p_index = 60 is out of bounds ((int)settings.size() = 0).\n   at: _update_joints (scene/3d/bone_twist_disperser_3d.cpp:604)\n[exit code 0]\n```\n\nAI assistance disclosure: AI tools were used to help inspect the issue and draft this small change/PR text. I reviewed the resulting code and ran the verification locally.\n","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121336/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null